      <title>Financial Giants Pose Hidden Societal Threats</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-09/financial-giants-pose-hidden-societal-threats</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">cf25e8dac0d442d5394f0b37</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 05:00:07 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>When Philadelphia National Bank was blocked from buying a local rival in the 1960s, the Supreme Court’s opinion contained a seminal insight about finance: If too few firms control the supply of funding for business, they will reshape the rest of the economy. “Concentration in banking accelerates concentration generally,” the judges wrote in the landmark decision.</description>
